{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>oops! Expiration Date Tracker 是一款協助用戶追蹤雪櫃食物到期日的工具，適合經常忘記食品期限、不想再面對變質氣味與可疑發現的人。它會在食物過期前適時提醒，無論是乳酪、果汁、橄欖、芝士或牛奶，都能減少浪費與尷尬。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-125.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>及時提醒避免食物變壞</h2>\n<p>oops! 會記錄雪櫃內食物的到期時間，並在期限將至時提醒用戶，讓乳酪、果汁、橄欖、芝士與牛奶等食品不會被遺忘。用戶可及早處理快將變壞的食物，減少異味與浪費，避免打開雪櫃時才發現黃瓜已變成木乃伊，或食物已出現令人尷尬的變化。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2556\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1179x2556bb-59.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2556\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1179x2556bb-60.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2556\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1179x2556bb-61.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2556\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1179x2556bb-62.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2556\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1179x2556bb-63.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：oops! Expiration Date Tracker</li><li>應用類別：Food &amp; Drink</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/oops-expiration-date-tracker/id1591883953?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T13:21:41.531667+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":333,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T13:01:35+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T07:18:58.483747+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T13:18:38.996005+00:00","content_hash":"92e55a00d68833f18aeeaa18089944f4fa301e951c9d8b205131e73ff0baa3ac","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}